Package: unichef
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}
Description: Unicode character analysis and data-transformation recipes
 UniChef inspects text at the code-point level (names, blocks, scripts,
 Unicode properties, normalization and grapheme clusters), detects
 invisible characters, bidirectional-control abuse and confusable
 homoglyphs, and runs deterministic recipes of encoding, hashing,
 encryption and text operations.
 .
 Recipes are interchangeable with the UniChef web application and
 browser extensions.
